1
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:13,260
(Yeah. Look at how the world spins for us. Mmm.)

2
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:18,620
La noche cae, empieza el juego.
(The night falls and the game begins.)

3
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:23,060
Tú me miras, yo no me niego.
(You look at me, I don't deny it.)

4
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:28,420
La pista brilla bajo la luz.
(The floor shines under the light.)

5
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:33,480
El único que importa eres tú.
(The only one that matters is you.)

6
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:38,200
Cierra la puerta, apaga la mente.
(Close the door, turn off the mind.)

7
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:42,900
Vamos a hacerlo muy diferente.
(Let's do it very differently.)

8
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:48,120
No digas nada, solo respira.
(Don't say anything, just breathe.)

9
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:52,600
Mira cómo el mundo nos gira.
(Look how the world spins for us.)

10
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:57,320
Levanta las manos al cielo.
(Raise your hands to the sky.)

11
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:02,240
Siente la música en el pelo.
(Feel the music in your hair.)

12
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:07,120
Mueve la cintura despacio.
(Move your waist slowly.)

13
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:11,980
Flotando libres en el espacio.
(Floating free in space.)

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:23,720
Cierra los ojos, bésame.
(Close your eyes, kiss me. Close your eyes, kiss me. Close your eyes, kiss me. Close your eyes, kiss me.)

15
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,700
Un paso al frente, dos para atrás.
(One step forward.)

16
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:29,140
Dime al oído que quieres más.

17
00:01:29,220 --> 00:01:31,480
Toco tu cara, piel de canela.

18
00:01:31,720 --> 00:01:34,020
Esta pasión que nos desvela.

19
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:36,520
Sigue mi ritmo, no te detengas.

20
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:41,420
Deja que la locura te envuelva.
(Let the madness wrap you.)

21
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:46,880
No digas nada, solo respira.
(Don't say anything, just breathe.)

22
00:01:46,940 --> 00:01:51,380
Mira cómo el mundo nos gira.
(Look how the world spins for us.)

23
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:56,100
Levanta las manos al cielo.
(Raise your hands to the sky.)

24
00:01:56,420 --> 00:02:01,020
Siente la música en el pelo.
(Feel the music in your hair.)

25
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:05,900
Mueve la cintura despacio.
(Move your waist slowly.)

26
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:10,780
Flotando libres en el espacio.
(Floating free in space.)

27
00:02:10,820 --> 00:02:23,120
Cierra los ojos, bésame.
(Close your eyes, kiss me. Close your eyes, kiss me. Close your eyes, kiss me. Close your eyes, kiss me.)

28
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:25,260
Hombros,
(shoulders.)

29
00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:28,000
Rodillas,
(knees.)

30
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,400
Labios,
(lips.)

31
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:30,900
Fuego.

32
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:35,500
Levanta las manos al cielo.
(Raise your hands to the sky.)

33
00:02:35,620 --> 00:02:40,280
Siente la música en el pelo.
(Feel the music in your hair.)

34
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:45,940
Solo tú y yo.
(Only you and me.)

35
00:02:46,020 --> 00:02:50,000
Despacio.
(Slowly.)
